{"id": "EUVD-2026-102960", "enisaUuid": "ca075e6d-92d7-35c2-85a5-c24bb8eb18e3", "description": "ZR.Admin.NET through 3.8.2 contains an sql injection vulnerability that allows authenticated attackers to manipulate the ORDER BY clause by supplying a crafted PagerInfo.Sort query parameter to the shared ToPage paging helper. Attackers holding the system:user:list permission can inject subquery or CASE expressions via GET /system/user/list to extract database contents such as stored credentials through blind techniques.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T20:59:36", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/zradmin-net-order-by-sort-sql-injection", "https://github.com/izhaorui/Zr.Admin.NET/blob/v3.8.1/ZR.Repository/BaseRepository.cs#L342-L351", "https://github.com/izhaorui/Zr.Admin.NET/blob/v3.8.1/ZR.Admin.WebApi/Controllers/System/SysUserController.cs#L47-L52", "https://github.com/izhaorui/Zr.Admin.NET/commit/d32c211aeedab3e07bb4f02f54bb251fff37361c", "https://gitee.com/izory/ZrAdminNetCore/tags", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/zr-admin-net-through-3.8.2-sql-injection-via-pagerinfo-sort-order-by"], "aliases": ["GHSA-vcvg-6jh6-f58f", "CVE-2026-111669"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "301e16ab-fed6-394f-b857-73314e5a201c", "product": {"name": "Zr.Admin.NET", "vendor": {"name": "izhaorui"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.8.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "352cf000-797d-3ec2-a2d9-d0e5553ea6ab", "vendor": {"name": "izhaorui"}}], "isExploited": false}